This project adapts the characteristic-two construction and uses supporting
Lean infrastructure from OpenAI Math, https://github.com/openai/math,
source revision fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb.
The vendor directory retains the upstream license and original source headers.
The vendor manifest identifies the copied supporting files.

The general Artin statement follows the Formal Conjectures Authors' source,
https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures,
revision d838afa7a62f66dc034c96fb011c10b9bde3f44c,
FormalConjectures/Paper/AuslanderReiten.lean (Apache-2.0).
Its conjectural proof body is not imported.

Presentation layout follows the user-specified reference repository
https://github.com/KitaKen1/bapat-lal-q-permanent-lean,
revision c459861078d42d22dd18144a103b2aee286dbf53.
The q-permanent proof and unrelated mathematical exposition are not included.
